# =============================================================================
# Copyrighted study material: never commit or publish these.
# =============================================================================
# The books are extraction input only. The shipped skill contains original
# operational prose that cites principle names; it never reproduces book text.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: an unanchored `clean-code.md` also matches the
# Windsurf and Cline adapter files (.windsurf/rules/clean-code.md,
# .clinerules/clean-code.md), which silently kept them out of every commit.
books/
*.pdf
/clean-code.md
/clean-code.pdf

# =============================================================================
# Locally installed skills and local agent state
# =============================================================================
# This repo is the source of skills/clean-code/. These directories are install
# targets and vendored copies, not repository content.
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
.agents/skills/
agent/
.serena/

# Working state written by the clean-code skill itself.
.clean/

# =============================================================================
# Build and release output
# =============================================================================
dist/
*.zip

# =============================================================================
# OS and editor noise
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# =============================================================================
# Tooling caches (the validators and CI run Python and npx)
# =============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
node_modules/
*.log
